@title Quarterly Results: Q4 2025 to Q3 2026
@subtitle Copperline Cafe · 14 locations · for franchise owners
@width wide

data q = quarter,revenue,cost of goods,labor,rent and other,operating profit; Q4 2025,1842000,589000,612000,398000,243000; Q1 2026,1756000,561000,598000,405000,192000; Q2 2026,1968000,618000,631000,412000,307000; Q3 2026,2134000,662000,676000,421000,375000
data m = quarter,margin; Q4 2025,13.2; Q1 2026,10.9; Q2 2026,15.6; Q3 2026,17.6

## Headline

kpi Q3 2026 revenue | $2.13M | +8.4% vs Q2 | good
kpi Q3 operating profit | $375K | 17.6% margin | good
kpi Trailing 4Q revenue | $7.70M | Q4 2025 to Q3 2026
kpi Trailing 4Q profit | $1.12M | 14.5% margin

Q3 2026 was the strongest quarter of the four: revenue was up 8.4% on Q2 and 15.9% on Q4 2025, and margin reached 17.6%.

