## Margin trend

chart line m y=margin unit=% target="14.5 trailing 4Q" labels title="Operating margin by quarter"

## Notes

- Q1 is the seasonal low.
- Two new locations opened on 2026-05-18, which explains part of the Q2 and Q3 growth.

! The Q3 2026 figures are unaudited.
